  "description": "When Henry Cuthbert asked for a worker to come help at his farm, he never expected a small, scrawny child to show up asking to be adopted! But little James swears to be a hard worker and grow up strong if Henry doesn't send him back to the orphanage. As the years pass and James grows older, the affection between the two grows stronger. Can these two men learn to heal from their dark pasts and care for one another? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
